  "translation": "Go na le motho bogošing bja gago go yo mo go welago ruakh ya Elohim ya bokgethwa; gomme matsatsing a ntatao go hweditšwe khanya le bohlale le botšebo, bjalo ka botšebo bja Elohim, go ena; gomme kgoši Nevukadnetshare, ntatao, kgoši, o mo thwaileng moetapele wa bagodi, ba-nyakisago-dinaledi, Bakasdi le ba-lahla-dingangakgolo —",
